{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207820","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207820","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1720782001:0":{"text":"珍妮，那个……那个银色的盘子，能摸吗？会不会赔不起啊？","source_cn":"珍妮，那个……那个银色的盘子，能摸吗？会不会赔不起啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83109AA08E85591D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720782002:1":{"text":"嘘！别乱动！我们看看就行了……","source_cn":"嘘！别乱动！我们看看就行了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28612BDCB47D60C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720782003:1":{"text":"这里太漂亮了……我们真的能待在这儿吗？会不会被赶出去啊？","source_cn":"这里太漂亮了……我们真的能待在这儿吗？会不会被赶出去啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF2F78F683724C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720782004:1":{"text":"罗万哥哥说了，是公主殿下邀请我们的……可是，公主殿下在哪儿呢？听说公主很威严，她会不会很凶？","source_cn":"罗万哥哥说了，是公主殿下邀请我们的……可是，公主殿下在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94DF17ADF5597B49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720782005:1":{"text":"谁说公主很凶的？我可听到了哦！","source_cn":"谁说公主很凶的？我可听到了哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x115B280E6C1D9011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720782006:1":{"text":"参、参见……","source_cn":"参、参见……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8907B8C9BF898DDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720782007:1":{"text":"好啦，在我这里不用那么拘束。桌上的这些食物——流蜜黄金肉饼，冰镇宝石果汁，皇家炙烤火鸡腿，都是为你们准备的！","source_cn":"好啦，在我这里不用那么拘束。桌上的这些食物——流蜜黄金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4248910B32A02F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720782008:1":{"text":"听说你们之前受了不少苦……以后不会了。在耀光，每一个孩子都应该有饭吃，有书读，有一个能遮风挡雨的家！","source_cn":"听说你们之前受了不少苦……以后不会了。在耀光，每一个孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0227AF752994E209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720782009:1":{"text":"公主姐姐……你的声音，和那个送我们去教堂的姐姐好像啊。","source_cn":"公主姐姐……你的声音，和那个送我们去教堂的姐姐好像啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68186CECE66A5D08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720782010:1":{"text":"是、是吗？可能是因为……我们都希望你们能开开心心地长大吧。","source_cn":"是、是吗？可能是因为……我们都希望你们能开开心心地长大吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1260F289F62E2AA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720782011:1":{"text":"